"quality_score": -1, "access_score": 0}]}, {"id": 
"20260628004105145905_db3d65bc", "type": "Claim", "text": "Scholarly opinion on 
the authenticity of the \"Ring of Nestor\" is divided: some authors argue it is 
an authentic Aegean work, while other scholars remain skeptical and treat it 
within the broader context of possible Aegean forgeries.", "source_ids": 
["20260628004021222852_03fa4b94"], "all_source_ids": 
["20260628003951064180_4a29628f", "20260628004021222852_03fa4b94", 
"20260628004021300624_ad4df5cc", "20260628004021325769_87368900"], "citations": 
