"https://ndl.ethernet.edu.et/bitstream/123456789/42873/1/12..Cathy%20Gere.pdf", 
"source_type": "paper", "quality_score": 5, "access_score": 0}]}, {"id": 
"20260628004022593301_cecaaabd", "type": "Evidence", "text": "The 
Academia-hosted paper is described as: 'This paper presents an analysis of the 
iconography surrounding the \"Ring of Nestor\" in the context of Aegean 
forgeries and authenticity debates.'", "source_ids": 
["20260628003951064180_4a29628f"], "all_source_ids": 
["20260628003951064180_4a29628f"], "citations": [2], "source_profiles": 
