Sir Arthur Evans whereas many other scholars condemned it as a forgery.”", 
"source_ids": ["20260628004916680829_39f17228"], "all_source_ids": 
["20260628004916680829_39f17228"], "citations": [26], "source_profiles": 
[{"source_id": "20260628004916680829_39f17228", "title": "The Pseudo-Minoan 
