"https://journals.librarypublishing.arizona.edu/jaei/article/id/960/", 
"source_type": "paper", "quality_score": 7, "access_score": 0}]}, {"id": 
"20260628005007027544_4baa653d", "type": "Claim", "text": "The ring’s wider 
scholarly status is disputed: Evans accepted it as authentic, while many later 
scholars regarded it as a forgery.", "source_ids": 
["20260628004916680829_39f17228"], "all_source_ids": 
["20260628004916680829_39f17228"], "citations": [26], "source_profiles": 
[{"source_id": "20260628004916680829_39f17228", "title": "The Pseudo-Minoan 
