"20260628005006940041_ce4e2e05", "type": "Claim", "text": "The Nestor Ring’s 
Kakovatos provenance should be treated as Arthur Evans’s attribution or belief, 
not as a firmly documented archaeological findspot in the provided evidence.", 
"source_ids": ["20260628004916760676_d08416e9"], "all_source_ids": 
